# Bot2 answers Maelstrom Pulse with Snakeskin Veil on the targeted Ornithopter: hexproof makes the spell's only target
# illegal, so the spell does not resolve (CR 608.2b) and the other Ornithopter, which the effect would have named, is not
# destroyed either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Maelstrom Pulse
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Snakeskin Veil
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Maelstrom Pulse.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Snakeskin Veil.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Keywords = Flying; Hexproof
Bot1.Graveyard = Maelstrom Pulse
Bot2.Graveyard = Snakeskin Veil
